# M14: a Cut or Copy of more than the clipboard holds (2,048 bytes) is refused and changes nothing (CORE-44). The paragraph is 2,400 bytes:
# Select All and Cut leave it whole with "The document is too large for Quill." on the status line; Copy says the same; Undo has nothing
# of the Cut to undo.
@copy bigsel.rtf
@open BIGSEL.RTF
f10 right l                     # Edit > Select All
f10 right t                     # Edit > Cut: refused, the text stays selected
f10 right c                     # Edit > Copy: refused as well
f10 right u                     # Edit > Undo: nothing was cut, so it undoes nothing the Cut did
f10 end enter                   # File > Exit
n                               # without saving
